                             RPC request has arrived on some RPC file descrip‐
                             tors; _r_d_f_d_s is the resultant read file descriptor
                             bit mask.  The routine returns when all file de‐
                             scriptors associated with the value of _r_d_f_d_s have
                             been serviced.

